# Build-context excludes for the API/web image builds (OPS-2).
# Context is the repo root; keep it lean.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.output
**/.vinxi
**/.nitro
**/.tanstack
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/.git
**/.github
**/*.log

# Local env + secrets (never bake into an image)
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local

# Editor / OS cruft
**/.DS_Store
**/.vscode
**/.idea

# Docs / non-build assets
.ai
**/*.md
!apps/api/README.md

# Web build caches (api build doesn't need the web app at all, but keep lean)
apps/web/.output
apps/web/.nitro
